        "reason": "A contract interface built from SEP-51 JSON by the oracle and wrapped in a header-only Wasm module; stellar-core never builds contract code, it stores the uploaded bytes unchanged. Element counts past the bounds removed in XDR v30: 11 inputs (was 10), 41 struct fields (was 40), 51 union and enum cases (was 50)."
